# Vimla v2 visual fidelity

Use `docs/design/references-v2` as the approved visual reference set.

- Foundation PNGs define theme/color/type/radii/density/icon direction.
- Component PNGs define reusable component proportions and states.
- Desktop/tablet/mobile PNGs define composition patterns.
- `08-auth-layout-concept.png` defines AUTH COMPOSITION ONLY; its old palette is not authoritative.
- Domain/contracts/i18n override generated screenshot text/data.

References are not vague inspiration. Match them closely using the shared system, but never pixel-trace via arbitrary coordinates.
